 "intro_zh": "丹霞山是世界地质公园、世界自然遗产、国家级风景名胜区、国家地质公园。丹霞山以“丹霞地貌”命名，在全世界已发现的1200多处丹霞地貌中，丹霞山是发育最典型、类型最齐全、造型最丰富、景色最优美的丹霞地貌之一。",
 "intro_en": "Danxia Mountain is a world geological park, a world natural heritage, a national scenic spot, and a national geopark. Danxia Mountain is named after \"Danxia Landform\". Among the more than 1,200 Danxia landforms discovered around the world, Danxia Mountain is one of the most typical Danxia landforms with the most complete types, richest shapes and most beautiful scenery.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
